# Cheat Sheet

## Headings

# H1  ## H2  ### H3  #### H4  ##### H5  ###### H6

## Text

**bold**  *italic*  ***bold italic***  ~~strike~~  `code`

## Lists

- item
1. item
- [x] done
- [ ] pending

## Variables

@let name = "World"
@let count = 42

Hello, {name}! Count: {count}
Filter: {name|upper}

## Conditionals

@if count > 10
Count is greater than 10
@else
Count is 10 or less
@endif

## Loops

@let fruits = ["apple", "banana", "cherry"]

@each fruit in fruits
- {fruit}
@end

## Alerts

@note
This is a note.
@end

@tip
This is a tip.
@end

## Math

Inline: $E = mc^2$

## Charts

@chart(type="bar" title="Demo")
data: [10, 25, 40, 30]
labels: ["A", "B", "C", "D"]
@end
